## Learning objectives

After reading this note, the reader should be able to:

1. Explain the core concept.
2. Implement a minimal example.
3. Recognize common errors and choose an appropriate pattern.

## Concept

Explain the abstraction, why it exists, and how it relates to nearby concepts.

