## Scientific computing example

Use a small bioinformatics or data-analysis task rather than a purely artificial example.

## Robust version

Add validation, error handling, logging, type hints or documentation, and tests where appropriate.

## Performance and design

Discuss readability first, then complexity, vectorization, memory, and profiling when relevant.

